{"id": "71555", "title": "秘术之天下无双", "author": "语夜听澜", "category": "侦探推理", "count": 186, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/71/71555/71555s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71555.htm", "intro": "我出身风水世家，可爷爷和爸爸却不让我学术数。高一那年，爷爷将那本霸道的奇书《无双谱》传给了我，并给我留下了一个神秘的预言，接着他就暴毙而亡。十年之间，我工作不顺，运气不佳，没有爱情，几次与死神擦肩而过，尝尽孤独，历尽坎坷。直到那一天，我在酒吧认识了一个茅山术师，她告诉我，我们是一条绳上的蚂蚱，合作的话，两人都可以得个高寿，不然的话，就各自回家准备后事吧……\n    黑岩阅读网支持第三方一键登录，包括腾讯QQ、新浪微博、微信、百度贴吧，实现极简登陆体验。", "base": "files/article/html/71/71555", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "01 无双谱", "file": "11210133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "02 命中贵人", "file": "11210134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "03 血灵黑巫", "file": "11210135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "04 武火冲经", "file": "11210136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "05 用心良苦", "file": "11210137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "06 前虎后狼", "file": "11210138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "07 讨灵", "file": "11210139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "08 脱胎换骨", "file": "11210140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "09 驱邪", "file": "11210141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10 灵光初现", "file": "11210142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11 辞职", "file": "11210143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12 五玄经", "file": "11210144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13 无价之宝", "file": "11210145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14 闭关", "file": "11210146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15 明朝怨灵", "file": "11210147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16 独眼凤凰", "file": "11210148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17 第一次破阵", "file": "11210149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18 天机", "file": "11210150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19 刀马旦", "file": "11210151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20 第一个红包", "file": "11210152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21 耳报神", "file": "11210153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22 林五爷", "file": "11210154.html", "available": f